T:A Detailed
T:History
T:------------
T:1. KIEVAN
T:862 AD:
T:East Slavs
T:united under
T:Rurik line.
T:Kievan Rus
T:became a
T:major power.
T:988 AD:
T:Adopted
T:Orthodox
T:Christianity
T:------------
T:2. MONGOLS
T:1240 AD:
T:Golden Horde
T:invaded Rus.
T:Cities fell.
T:Princes paid
T:heavy tax
T:for 200 yrs.
T:------------
T:3. MOSCOW
T:Grand Duchy
T:of Moscow
T:grew strong.
T:Ivan III
T:ended Mongol
T:rule (1480).
T:Ivan IV
T:became the
T:1st Tsar in
T:1547.
T:------------
T:4. ROMANOV
T:1613:
T:House of
T:Romanov
T:took power.
T:Peter Great
T:built St.
T:Petersburg
T:and reformed
T:the empire.
T:Catherine II
T:expanded
T:borders.
T:------------
T:5. EMPIRE
T:1812:
T:Napoleon
T:invaded.
T:French army
T:retreated.
T:Empire grew
T:across Asia
T:to Pacific.
T:------------
T:6. 1917 REV
T:WWI strain
T:ended Tsar
T:rule.
T:Bolsheviks
T:led by Lenin
T:took power.
T:USSR was
T:born in 1922
T:------------
T:7. USSR ERA
T:Industrial
T:growth.
T:WWII victory
T:at big cost.
T:Cold War era
T:Space Race:
T:Sputnik 1957
T:Yuri Gagarin
T:in space!
T:------------
